{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the role of a totally normal robot vacuum in a total normal human world. Clean messes, roll around the house, and experience life as a robot vacuum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this 3rd person little adventure game you take on the responsibilities of being a robot vacuum! You'll roll around the house cleaning up messes, making sure to keep the house clean, then return to base to end the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you clean you might notice the owner of the house having conversations, perhaps they are important?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing as a robot vacuum</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">cleaning messes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">listening in on conversations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and did I mention.. cleaning messes??</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615590?t=1743118825","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615590?t=1743118825","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615590/ae1319bf8f1120f8ea5117d02befa3ed76674e3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743118825","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615590/ae1319bf8f1120f8ea5117d02befa3ed76674e3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743118825","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains a depiction of suicide."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the role of a totally normal robot vacuum in a total normal human world. Clean messes, roll around the house, and experience life as a robot vacuum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this 3rd person little adventure game you take on the responsibilities of being a robot vacuum! You'll roll around the house cleaning up messes, making sure to keep the house clean, then return to base to end the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you clean you might notice the owner of the house having conversations, perhaps they are important?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing as a robot vacuum</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">cleaning messes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">listening in on conversations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and did I mention.. cleaning messes??</p>","developers":["Lord Soul Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615590/436e9d08d1ec25dba7a2a131372eda440e8297ee/header.jpg?t=1743118825","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118224,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118224/movie480.mp4?t=1743118604","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118224/movie_max.mp4?t=1743118604"},"name":"My Life as Robot Vacuum Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118224/1fb8a7245dc81cb31eb414367bd1e0ef60c761d2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743118604","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118224/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743118604","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118224/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743118604"}}],"name":"My Life as a Robot Vacuum","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><str